./.agents/skills/dsh-spec-agent-notes/SKILL.md:10:An Agent Note is a durable decision record: the *why* and the *what was given up* that code, tests and ordinary documentation cannot carry. It survives the session that produced it; a later session or maintainer can recover the rationale instead of re-litigating it.
